    <briefdescription>
<para>An analysis pass to compute the <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_call_graph" kindref="compound">CallGraph</ref></computeroutput> for a <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module" kindref="compound">Module</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the concept of an analysis pass used by the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1af9c9208365fd9ce11392b4d79485e259" kindref="member">ModuleAnalysisManager</ref></computeroutput> to run an analysis over a module and cache the resulting data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
